        "Safety – do not use while driving" to "Do not operate or read the app while driving. Set it up before you start and let a passenger use it, or rely only on the voice announcements. You are fully responsible for driving safely and obeying traffic laws.",
        "Diagnostics are a guide only" to "Readings, fault-code explanations, root-cause suggestions, health scores, range and eco estimates and other \"AI\" results are produced by rules and calculations on your phone. They can be wrong or incomplete. Always confirm faults with a qualified mechanic before repairs, and do not ignore warning lights on the dashboard.",
